    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_01",
      "hash64": "F21FF600C8F591D1",
      "text": "……那么，等稍后到了\\n练钢琴的时间我们再见。[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_02",
      "hash64": "F21FF300C8F58CB8",
      "text": "请把这句话转达给少爷。[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_sitappa_01",
      "hash64": "C28BA22AC279F395",
      "text": "我、我知道了！\\n木非！[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_03",
      "hash64": "F21FF400C8F58E6B",
      "text": "……哦？[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_04",
      "hash64": "F21FF900C8F596EA",
      "text": "您也是少爷的同学吗？[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "39F812E04BEE9F91",
      "text": "少爷？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "39F80FE04BEE9A78",
      "text": "我不知道",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_05",
      "hash64": "F21FFA00C8F5989D",
      "text": "是这样啊……[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_06",
      "hash64": "F21FF700C8F59384",
      "text": "您可能不知道，\\n这里是奥尔迪加少爷率领的\\r\\n妖精帮班阁道三小队基地。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_sitappa_02",
      "hash64": "C28B9F2AC279EE7C",
      "text": "那、那个，别随便把这种事\\n告诉[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]他她……[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_07",
      "hash64": "F21FF800C8F59537",
      "text": "真是失礼了。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_08",
      "hash64": "F21FED00C8F58286",
      "text": "这位是什么人呢？[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_sitappa_03",
      "hash64": "C28BA02AC279F02F",
      "text": "大概是我们的敌人！[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_09",
      "hash64": "F21FEE00C8F58439",
      "text": "原来如此，也就是说\\n您是少爷的敌人……是这样吧？[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_select_03",
      "hash64": "39F810E04BEE9C2B",
      "text": "没错！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_select_04",
      "hash64": "39F815E04BEEA4AA",
      "text": "是这样……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_10",
      "hash64": "F2237B00C8F8A9A7",
      "text": "嗯，是这样啊。\\n既然如此……[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_sitappa_04",
      "hash64": "C28B9D2AC279EB16",
      "text": "哎……？[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_11",
      "hash64": "F2237A00C8F8A7F4",
      "text": "能请您和我来一场对战吗？[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_12",
      "hash64": "F2237D00C8F8AD0D",
      "text": "您需要准备一下吗？\\n如果需要的话，我等您。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_13",
      "hash64": "F2237C00C8F8AB5A",
      "text": "那么，请接招吧。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_14",
      "hash64": "F2237700C8F8A2DB",
      "text": "……太精彩了。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_15",
      "hash64": "F2237600C8F8A128",
      "text": "我的主人奥尔迪加少爷\\n实力在我之上，\\r\\n请您多加小心。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_jentle_16",
      "hash64": "F2237900C8F8A641",
      "text": "那么，先告辞了。[VAR 0x0114(003C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_sitappa_05",
      "hash64": "C28B9E2AC279ECC9",
      "text": "今、今天星苦了～……[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_sitappa_06",
      "hash64": "C28B9B2AC279E7B0",
      "text": "刚才那位绅士啊，他是学院的\\n上一任校长？好像是这样？\\r\\n现在负责教育老大？听说是这样。\\r\\n有时还会来迎接老大？可能是这样……[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_sitappa_07",
      "hash64": "C28B9C2AC279E963",
      "text": "……啊，\\n现在不是说这些的时候！[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_sitappa_08",
      "hash64": "C28BA92AC279FF7A",
      "text": "我确信你是我们的敌人，\\n所以我要去报告～了！[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_010_sitappa_09",
      "hash64": "C28BAA2AC27A012D",
      "text": "今天星苦了～！[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
